      "kind": "music",
      "target_bus": "Music",
      "max_sec": 0.0,
      "when": "event:level_started:1",
      "final_file": "res://assets/audio/music/theme_tier1.ogg",
      "note": "دشتِ آفتابی — بیشترین نُت، روشن‌ترین"
    },
    {
      "id": "theme_tier2",
      "kind": "music",
      "target_bus": "Music",
      "max_sec": 0.0,
      "when": "event:level_started:2",
      "final_file": "res://assets/audio/music/theme_tier2.ogg",
      "note": "غارهای زمزمه — فاصلهٔ سومِ کم‌نور، کفِ صدا"
    },
    {
      "id": "theme_tier3",
      "kind": "music",
      "target_bus": "Music",
      "max_sec": 0.0,
      "when": "event:level_started:3",
      "final_file": "res://assets/audio/music/theme_tier3.ogg",
      "note": "خرابه‌های نورِ شبح — پنجمِ اضافه، بی‌قرار"
    },
    {
      "id": "theme_tier4",
      "kind": "music",
      "target_bus": "Music",
      "max_sec": 0.0,
      "when": "event:level_started:4",
      "final_file": "res://assets/audio/music/theme_tier4.ogg",
      "note": "رصدخانهٔ دوقلو — دو لایهٔ هم‌زمان با هم‌خانوادگیِ تم ۱"
    },
    {
      "id": "theme_tier5",
      "kind": "music",
      "target_bus": "Music",
      "max_sec": 0.0,
      "when": "event:level_started:5",
      "final_file": "res://assets/audio/music/theme_tier5.ogg",
      "note": "قلهٔ تعادل — هر چهار منطقه در یک آکوردِ روشن"
